sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    loop each wayside, every scan
        M->>W: program loaded?
        W-->>M: ready, or no PLC program
        M->>M: CtcReport(wayside, line, ready, reason, blocks)
        Note right of M: Each block: occupied, and the Track Model's own switch, crossing and signal read-back. No failures, no trains.
    end
    M-->>H: ctc_reports
    H->>CTC: one report per wayside
    alt every wayside on a line is ready
        CTC->>CTC: the line is ready: dispatch, suggest speeds and authorities (UC-10)
    else any is not
        CTC->>CTC: send nothing on that line, show which waysides are not ready
    end
